{"concept":"child","groups":[{"id":"child-context","name":{"ru":"Детскость, дети и сравнения","en":"Childhood, children and comparisons"},"count":39},{"id":"metamorphosis","name":{"ru":"Дитя превращения духа","en":"The spirit’s metamorphosis into a child"},"count":4},{"id":"innocence","name":{"ru":"Невинность и её речевые роли","en":"Innocence and its speech roles"},"count":23},{"id":"parenthood","name":{"ru":"Дети и родительство","en":"Children and parenthood"},"count":8},{"id":"dream-child","name":{"ru":"Дитя сна и зеркало","en":"Dream child and mirror"},"count":2},{"id":"children-work","name":{"ru":"Дети, дело и будущая земля","en":"Children, work and future land"},"count":18},{"id":"teacher-childhood","name":{"ru":"Детство учителя","en":"The teacher’s childhood"},"count":3},{"id":"eternity-children","name":{"ru":"Дети любимой вечности","en":"Children of beloved eternity"},"count":7}],"occurrences":[{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e9243765f0515d24809ad38c4a1b5e0b","tos.text-unit.sid-e9243765f0515d24809ad38c4a1b5e0b"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"saint","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"child-context","neighbours":["will","becoming","saint"],"line":{"ru":"Святой называет Заратустру пробуждённым ребёнком.","en":"The saint calls Zarathustra an awakened child."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-32dbfb5bbf74851f8e864356790d227e","tos.text-unit.sid-32dbfb5bbf74851f8e864356790d227e"]},"form":"Kinde","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"metamorphosis","neighbours":["lion","becoming","camel","three-metamorphoses","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Три превращения ведут дух от верблюда через льва к дитяти.","en":"Three metamorphoses lead the spirit from camel through lion to child."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f9c4ff1773a49108cc92e6a5d92d12e9","tos.text-unit.sid-f9c4ff1773a49108cc92e6a5d92d12e9"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"metamorphosis","neighbours":["lion","becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель спрашивает, что может сделать ребёнок, чего не мог бы лев, и почему лев должен стать ребёнком.","en":"The teacher asks what the child can do that the lion could not, and why the lion must become a child."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-78b5795aca827182f53ba266a3271646","tos.text-unit.sid-78b5795aca827182f53ba266a3271646"]},"form":"Unschuld","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"metamorphosis","neighbours":["affirmation","memory","wheel","innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Дитя есть невинность и забвение, игра и начальное движение.","en":"The child is innocence and forgetting, play and a first movement."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ccc7806124ec31846e1bad6d832b4ee1","tos.text-unit.sid-ccc7806124ec31846e1bad6d832b4ee1"]},"form":"Kinde","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"metamorphosis","neighbours":["lion","becoming","camel","three-metamorphoses","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Конец речи вновь собирает три превращения духа.","en":"The speech’s close gathers the spirit’s three metamorphoses again."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-396791c1b6d5b389a77087b40150f1ef","tos.text-unit.sid-396791c1b6d5b389a77087b40150f1ef"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["body-self","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Ребёнок называет себя телом и душой.","en":"The child calls itself body and soul."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9f0f8d227683ca516852e6f3238c1ffe","tos.text-unit.sid-9f0f8d227683ca516852e6f3238c1ffe"]},"form":"Kinderei","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Привязанность к малым удовольствиям сопровождается насмешкой над собой.","en":"Attachment to small pleasures comes with self-mockery."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-94c952965082288d88df38b2444c7bd1","tos.text-unit.sid-94c952965082288d88df38b2444c7bd1"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["zarathustra","death-preachers"],"line":{"ru":"Проповедники смерти называют сладострастие грехом и призывают не рождать детей.","en":"Death preachers call sensuality sin and reject having children."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b333922596bf7a1978c0e93a4f2be910","tos.text-unit.sid-b333922596bf7a1978c0e93a4f2be910"]},"form":"Unschuld","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"innocence","neighbours":["innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Малые души при всей своей невинности жаждут крови и кусают.","en":"Little souls thirst for blood and bite in all their innocence."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-cb3fb0ed26d3c71b9490682e438fca66","tos.text-unit.sid-cb3fb0ed26d3c71b9490682e438fca66"]},"form":"unschuldig","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"innocence","neighbours":["innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Мягкость оправдывает малых, а они винят великое существование.","en":"Gentleness excuses the small while they blame great existence."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.14","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-29c853deeb3d380f67906fa320e0050c","tos.text-unit.sid-29c853deeb3d380f67906fa320e0050c"]},"form":"Unschuld","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"innocence","neighbours":["attention","innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Заратустра желает слушателям совершенства зверей, которым принадлежит невинность.","en":"Zarathustra wishes his listeners the perfection of animals, to whom innocence belongs."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.14","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-d0283e4de4b0811ab85862625280d433","tos.text-unit.sid-d0283e4de4b0811ab85862625280d433"]},"form":"Unschuld","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"innocence","neighbours":["innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Чувствам предложена невинность.","en":"The senses are offered innocence."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9340995fed68797913d14822c1682826","tos.text-unit.sid-9340995fed68797913d14822c1682826"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"unidentified-questioner","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"parenthood","neighbours":["bestowing-virtue","becoming","identity","unidentified-questioner"],"line":{"ru":"Старушка спрашивает о спрятанном сокровище или ребёнке.","en":"The old woman asks about a hidden treasure or child."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-800333e8f015eea1730364b1b843fb2a","tos.text-unit.sid-800333e8f015eea1730364b1b843fb2a"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"unidentified-questioner","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"parenthood","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Малая истина изображена непослушным ребёнком.","en":"The little truth is pictured as an unruly child."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-40c04392614ddd66a82bb966a3b6e942","tos.text-unit.sid-40c04392614ddd66a82bb966a3b6e942"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"old-woman","mode":"quoted","use":"image","group":"parenthood","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"В речи Заратустры ребёнок назван целью женщины.","en":"In Zarathustra’s speech the child is named woman’s aim."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ad2561b6b6a3eb23f2a28b8d9d0d2d12","tos.text-unit.sid-ad2561b6b6a3eb23f2a28b8d9d0d2d12"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"old-woman","mode":"quoted","use":"image","group":"parenthood","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Речь различает понимание детей и собственную детскость.","en":"The speech distinguishes understanding children and being childlike oneself."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2c32cf66be02b5fc08681c1674992729","tos.text-unit.sid-2c32cf66be02b5fc08681c1674992729"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"old-woman","mode":"quoted","use":"image","group":"parenthood","neighbours":["will","innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Скрытый в мужчине ребёнок хочет игры.","en":"The child hidden in the man wants play."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-24a4953564d689112d747dd5bee319f2","tos.text-unit.sid-24a4953564d689112d747dd5bee319f2"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"marriage-questioner","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"parenthood","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Желание ребёнка становится вопросом о достойном родителе.","en":"Wanting a child becomes a question of a worthy parent."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-80f532c53be87849032cabfd95c48ff4","tos.text-unit.sid-80f532c53be87849032cabfd95c48ff4"]},"form":"Kinde","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"marriage-questioner","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"parenthood","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Победа и свобода должны страстно желать ребёнка; освобождению нужно строить живые памятники.","en":"Victory and freedom should long for a child; living monuments should be built to liberation."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.21","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e1755795e847e90201fddc9bd4e82c82","tos.text-unit.sid-e1755795e847e90201fddc9bd4e82c82"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"marriage-questioner","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"parenthood","neighbours":["laughter","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Суд ребёнка обращён к браку родителей.","en":"The child’s judgment addresses the parents’ marriage."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.22","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-d011a82fc32d99a3cdc7ef437c7cb537","tos.text-unit.sid-d011a82fc32d99a3cdc7ef437c7cb537"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["courage","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Зрелый мужчина сохраняет больше детства и меньше печали.","en":"The mature man retains more childhood and less sadness."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-474041af8e46b8564e0b60045b07e736","tos.text-unit.sid-474041af8e46b8564e0b60045b07e736"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["great-noon","will","becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Дети одной надежды приглашаются к празднику полдня.","en":"Children of one hope are invited to noon’s festival."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-aff5ee11c62dd7701cd3850da2b5a543","tos.text-unit.sid-aff5ee11c62dd7701cd3850da2b5a543"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"dream","use":"question","group":"dream-child","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Дитя с зеркалом тревожит сон учителя.","en":"The child with the mirror troubles the teacher’s sleep."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e3373aa308cb5065034fbd0b3f8e23ff","tos.text-unit.sid-e3373aa308cb5065034fbd0b3f8e23ff"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"child-mirror","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"dream","use":"image","group":"dream-child","neighbours":["child-mirror"],"line":{"ru":"Дитя сна требует взглянуть на себя в зеркало.","en":"The dream child demands a look at oneself in the mirror."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-8633a4e29cd08c654ad688a5aef20edc","tos.text-unit.sid-8633a4e29cd08c654ad688a5aef20edc"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["will","becoming","identity","creation","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Чтобы созидающий стал новорождённым, он должен захотеть быть роженицей и пережить родильные муки.","en":"To become newborn, the creator must will to be in labor and suffer birth pangs."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-438b5bcc67445dfed3c0f61db74b8cbe","tos.text-unit.sid-438b5bcc67445dfed3c0f61db74b8cbe"]},"form":"Unschuld","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"innocence","neighbours":["will","becoming","joy-lust","innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Невинность познания раскрывается желанием рождения.","en":"Knowing’s innocence unfolds as the desire to beget."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-0ecf7990e98ffddc44d157731bf54e93","tos.text-unit.sid-0ecf7990e98ffddc44d157731bf54e93"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["will","attention","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Любовь к добродетели сравнивается с материнской.","en":"Love of virtue is compared to a mother’s love."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-6fa953c147f60da651d31b76099054fa","tos.text-unit.sid-6fa953c147f60da651d31b76099054fa"]},"form":"Kinde","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["agency","body-self","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Пусть ваше Само отражается в поступках, как мать в ребёнке.","en":"The self is to be present in action as a mother in her child."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-fa8ee9e9c84be489f25cdfffd26136bd","tos.text-unit.sid-fa8ee9e9c84be489f25cdfffd26136bd"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Лишённая любимых слов добродетель сердится словно ребёнок.","en":"Virtue deprived of its favourite words grows angry like a child."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-7895aa2bdcdf9c3741da8fb97e143221","tos.text-unit.sid-7895aa2bdcdf9c3741da8fb97e143221"]},"form":"unschuldig","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"innocence","neighbours":["innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Разлучённые образы юности признаются невиновными друг перед другом.","en":"Parted visions of youth are declared innocent toward each other."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-789df6479345577ac73fd59bcdf0e7e7","tos.text-unit.sid-789df6479345577ac73fd59bcdf0e7e7"]},"form":"Unschuldigster","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"innocence","neighbours":["dance","innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Песнь убивает восторг того, кто был готов к лучшему танцу.","en":"The song kills the rapture of the one ready for a better dance."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-862eabe3810aa2263e3330c9c2600d94","tos.text-unit.sid-862eabe3810aa2263e3330c9c2600d94"]},"form":"Kindern","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["redemption","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Победителю поручено превратить чудовищ в небесных детей.","en":"The victor is charged with turning monsters into heavenly children."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.14","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c2ff850629cc3d9b37df0382f4f9344d","tos.text-unit.sid-c2ff850629cc3d9b37df0382f4f9344d"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"children-work","neighbours":["love-of-the-farthest","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Любовь обращается к ещё неоткрытой земле детей.","en":"Love turns toward the still undiscovered land of children."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.14","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-acc2e29d0a2a028d71a89537f24bbec4","tos.text-unit.sid-acc2e29d0a2a028d71a89537f24bbec4"]},"form":"Kindern","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"children-work","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Заратустра хочет искупить своими детьми то, что он потомок своих отцов.","en":"Zarathustra wants to redeem through his children his descent from his fathers."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.15","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3e89fabd94c1d4744a981ff327a5b181","tos.text-unit.sid-3e89fabd94c1d4744a981ff327a5b181"]},"form":"Unschuld","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"innocence","neighbours":["innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Тем, кто называет своё познание чистым, недостаёт невинности в желании.","en":"Those claiming pure knowledge lack innocence in desire."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.15","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ac66b7d57fcf56c46931688363c9cb22","tos.text-unit.sid-ac66b7d57fcf56c46931688363c9cb22"]},"form":"Unschuld","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"innocence","neighbours":["will","creation","innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Невинность — там, где есть воля к рождению и желание созидать дальше себя.","en":"Innocence unfolds as willing to beget and create beyond oneself."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.15","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-039ca52037e007f2e41a6a58f2be366b","tos.text-unit.sid-039ca52037e007f2e41a6a58f2be366b"]},"form":"Unschuld","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"innocence","neighbours":["creation","earth","innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Любовь солнца к земле названа невинностью и жаждой творца.","en":"The sun’s love for earth is named innocent creative desire."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-0843f4ea770499db005a490f4a9a893e","tos.text-unit.sid-0843f4ea770499db005a490f4a9a893e"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Ребёнок сообщает о разрыве учителя с учёными.","en":"A child reports the teacher’s break with the scholars."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e1c255ce5c82e02157516b8ca9767d98","tos.text-unit.sid-e1c255ce5c82e02157516b8ca9767d98"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель выбирает место рядом с играющими детьми.","en":"The teacher chooses a place beside playing children."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-98d02a89e407c0ed1e9df0695df866b0","tos.text-unit.sid-98d02a89e407c0ed1e9df0695df866b0"]},"form":"Kindern","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"innocence","neighbours":["body-self","innocence-play","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9e0798712d8ab5660273cbdc523710a1","tos.text-unit.sid-9e0798712d8ab5660273cbdc523710a1"]},"form":"Kindern","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"dream","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["laughter","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Во сне смеются и издеваются облики детей, ангелов, сов, глупцов и бабочек.","en":"In the dream, figures of children, angels, owls, fools and butterflies laugh and mock."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-22cedc5ab672d5d08e0ab91224b1509e","tos.text-unit.sid-22cedc5ab672d5d08e0ab91224b1509e"]},"form":"Kindsgelächter","speaker":"disciples","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["identity","laughter","disciples"],"line":{"ru":"Ученик толкует Заратустру как детский смех в гробницах.","en":"The disciple interprets Zarathustra as children’s laughter in tombs."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-fe3bfae6076dfafacd4eee699c467f1a","tos.text-unit.sid-fe3bfae6076dfafacd4eee699c467f1a"]},"form":"Kindes","speaker":"disciples","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["becoming","identity","laughter","disciples"],"line":{"ru":"Ученик обещает детский смех из гробов и могучий ветер, побеждающий смертельную усталость.","en":"The disciple promises children’s laughter from graves and a mighty wind overcoming mortal weariness."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-6b5c64318b543f6bb5b9bfd349025af9","tos.text-unit.sid-dce9a2b4c0bcf930ec2bb013849825fe"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["identity","redemption","zarathustra","revenge-madness"],"line":{"ru":"«Безумие» изображает время пожирающим своих детей.","en":"“Madness” pictures time devouring its children."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.22","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a307c0932d49f2e69c838bae6bde61e2","tos.text-unit.sid-a307c0932d49f2e69c838bae6bde61e2"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"dream","use":"image","group":"teacher-childhood","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель плачет ребёнком перед требованием, превышающим его силы.","en":"The teacher cries like a child before a demand beyond his strength."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.22","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-dc65f22cadd54497ed5c2d34c255e434","tos.text-unit.sid-dc65f22cadd54497ed5c2d34c255e434"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"dream","use":"image","group":"teacher-childhood","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra","quietest-hour"],"line":{"ru":"Тишайший час говорит учителю стать ребёнком, чтобы стыд не мешал ему.","en":"The stillest hour tells the teacher to become a child so shame will not hinder him."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.22","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a9c0eb0ec38029021c325376471c31f6","tos.text-unit.sid-a9c0eb0ec38029021c325376471c31f6"]},"form":"Kinde","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"disciples","mode":"dream","use":"image","group":"teacher-childhood","neighbours":["will","becoming","zarathustra","quietest-hour"],"line":{"ru":"Новое детство требует преодолеть собственную юность.","en":"New childhood requires overcoming one’s youth."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3d3e4d77d940f820148e2c057cb3b3ea","tos.text-unit.sid-3d3e4d77d940f820148e2c057cb3b3ea"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"sailors","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["affirmation","attention","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Вой собаки возвращает мысль к самому раннему детству.","en":"A dog’s howl returns thought to earliest childhood."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9a569797e78bce3b2eb90bc6e1383092","tos.text-unit.sid-9a569797e78bce3b2eb90bc6e1383092"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"children-work","neighbours":["identity","creation","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Созидающий должен сам создать детей своей надежды.","en":"The creator must make the children of their hope."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-d835d9aa4573179dfd12eb09143373fc","tos.text-unit.sid-d835d9aa4573179dfd12eb09143373fc"]},"form":"Kindern","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"children-work","neighbours":["will","body-self","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Ради детей учитель должен завершить самого себя.","en":"For his children the teacher must complete himself."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b10d176129363e66ce6fabcb59637c7e","tos.text-unit.sid-b10d176129363e66ce6fabcb59637c7e"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"children-work","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Своё дитя и своё дело любят от всего сердца; великая любовь к себе названа признаком беременности.","en":"Great love of oneself is called a sign of pregnancy."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-21ef632e5f4a7e27d5dfb877595033f0","tos.text-unit.sid-21ef632e5f4a7e27d5dfb877595033f0"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"children-work","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Дети учителя цветут первой весной, как деревья его сада.","en":"The teacher’s children are pictured as trees in a first spring garden."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-637037bffdfcf3da12589fda503048a5","tos.text-unit.sid-637037bffdfcf3da12589fda503048a5"]},"form":"Kindern","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"children-work","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Желание любви сковывает созидающего любовью к детям.","en":"Longing for love binds the creator through love of his children."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-d655fd1988a317e942d83ce00fa6bb73","tos.text-unit.sid-d655fd1988a317e942d83ce00fa6bb73"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"children-work","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель хочет обладать детьми с уверенностью, без желания.","en":"The teacher seeks secure having of the children beyond craving."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3dd1be4e820bbb38e4b476baaf8873ab","tos.text-unit.sid-3dd1be4e820bbb38e4b476baaf8873ab"]},"form":"Kindern","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"children-work","neighbours":["affirmation","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель отсылает счастливый час благословить детей.","en":"The teacher sends the happy hour to bless the children."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.04","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b8afbbe9331f6485503ef30a374219dc","tos.text-unit.sid-b8afbbe9331f6485503ef30a374219dc"]},"form":"Unschuld","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"innocence","neighbours":["innocence-play","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.04","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f5bfc91bb67aca2f0758c4e4166ac242","tos.text-unit.sid-f5bfc91bb67aca2f0758c4e4166ac242"]},"form":"Unschuld","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"innocence","neighbours":["courage","affirmation","innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Над всеми вещами стоит небо случая, невинности и дерзновения.","en":"Chance’s, innocence’s and exuberance’s sky is affirmed above things."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a75a2bbaa42bab97dfa59cd1a1eff62a","tos.text-unit.sid-a75a2bbaa42bab97dfa59cd1a1eff62a"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"child-context","neighbours":["difference","agency","innocence-play","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a733b7493c4268046bdd74258dc876e1","tos.text-unit.sid-a733b7493c4268046bdd74258dc876e1"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["will","zarathustra","small-people"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-510aad23d3644289caf666619e978607","tos.text-unit.sid-510aad23d3644289caf666619e978607"]},"form":"unschuldig","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"innocence","neighbours":["innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Случай принимается как невинный ребёнок.","en":"Chance is welcomed as an innocent child."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.08","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e5d0619f10dad10ca9c703ed9da4487b","tos.text-unit.sid-e5d0619f10dad10ca9c703ed9da4487b"]},"form":"Kindlein","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Отступники хотят вернуться к благочестивому детству.","en":"The apostates want to return to pious childhood."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.08","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e1a53039525c77981878ba077fa2d0f3","tos.text-unit.sid-e1a53039525c77981878ba077fa2d0f3"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["agency","zarathustra","night-watchman-1"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.08","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b110de413385192a88a37e8561bd5a98","tos.text-unit.sid-b110de413385192a88a37e8561bd5a98"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["zarathustra","night-watchman-2"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.08","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-d84501f8b891c161cfb6ea4aa6a6cabd","tos.text-unit.sid-d84501f8b891c161cfb6ea4aa6a6cabd"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"child-context","neighbours":["will","identity","zarathustra","night-watchman-1"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.09","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b7fee75ac8594535d17674e059c51f55","tos.text-unit.sid-b7fee75ac8594535d17674e059c51f55"]},"form":"unschuldig","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"loneliness","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"innocence","neighbours":["identity","innocence-play","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.09","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-96fb1ce31e5872f331bab8018a8cfaea","tos.text-unit.sid-96fb1ce31e5872f331bab8018a8cfaea"]},"form":"Unschuld","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"loneliness","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"innocence","neighbours":["innocence-play","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-606c82a59fec647f79aed0664b22aa88","tos.text-unit.sid-606c82a59fec647f79aed0664b22aa88"]},"form":"unschuldig","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"innocence","neighbours":["earth","innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Сладострастие для свободных сердец невинно и свободно; оно — избыток благодарности будущего настоящему.","en":"Lust is innocent and free for free hearts; it is the future’s overflowing gratitude to the present."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-659764c6461446bf6a4090a733a34c0a","tos.text-unit.sid-659764c6461446bf6a4090a733a34c0a"]},"form":"unschuldigen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"innocence","neighbours":["innocence-play","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-710952c41d23923e1317605e9bb5219c","tos.text-unit.sid-710952c41d23923e1317605e9bb5219c"]},"form":"Kindlein","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["identity","creation","spirit-of-gravity","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-85e76d4b805b2045b2807be1d3bdb3d1","tos.text-unit.sid-85e76d4b805b2045b2807be1d3bdb3d1"]},"form":"Unschuld","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"innocence","neighbours":["will","innocence-play","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-84372be8e00752c845bc3a1987f79499","tos.text-unit.sid-84372be8e00752c845bc3a1987f79499"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"children-work","neighbours":["love-of-the-farthest","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Любовь направляется к неоткрытой земле детей.","en":"Love is directed toward the undiscovered land of children."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a99544808fde51500062340690366a76","tos.text-unit.sid-a99544808fde51500062340690366a76"]},"form":"Kindern","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"children-work","neighbours":["redemption","tablets-values","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Своими детьми вы должны искупить то, что вы дети своих отцов, и спасти всё прошлое.","en":"Through your children you must redeem being the children of your fathers, and save all the past."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-8ac0e1e8a87f322f0f033101035ede36","tos.text-unit.sid-8ac0e1e8a87f322f0f033101035ede36"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"children-work","neighbours":["zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-8fec9c770b9473d08f7be29c392cc78d","tos.text-unit.sid-8fec9c770b9473d08f7be29c392cc78d"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"children-work","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Корабль направляется к земле будущих детей.","en":"The ship steers toward the future children’s land."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.15","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4f58c77ffaed2a2e1f2b71c262b02e1e","tos.text-unit.sid-4f58c77ffaed2a2e1f2b71c262b02e1e"]},"form":"unschuldige","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"life","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"innocence","neighbours":["innocence-play","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a71211ffc3b2ed2d7ebfc9f5b5285bf2","tos.text-unit.sid-a71211ffc3b2ed2d7ebfc9f5b5285bf2"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"eternity","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"eternity-children","neighbours":["eternity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Вечность названа любимой, от которой желают детей.","en":"Eternity is named the beloved from whom children are desired."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-0ea7710750cf664aaa9eb3a7bfe97a01","tos.text-unit.sid-0ea7710750cf664aaa9eb3a7bfe97a01"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"eternity","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"eternity-children","neighbours":["eternity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Вечность названа любимой, от которой желают детей.","en":"Eternity is named the beloved from whom children are desired."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c80fad1f6dc20c51232bc9a78118af10","tos.text-unit.sid-c80fad1f6dc20c51232bc9a78118af10"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"eternity","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"eternity-children","neighbours":["eternity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Вечность названа любимой, от которой желают детей.","en":"Eternity is named the beloved from whom children are desired."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-be06ce29d3dcbe32bf729ae0bdf20fce","tos.text-unit.sid-be06ce29d3dcbe32bf729ae0bdf20fce"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"eternity","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"eternity-children","neighbours":["eternity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Вечность названа любимой, от которой желают детей.","en":"Eternity is named the beloved from whom children are desired."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3888615472b3ec16b51487a9cd494af1","tos.text-unit.sid-3888615472b3ec16b51487a9cd494af1"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"eternity","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"eternity-children","neighbours":["eternity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Вечность названа любимой, от которой желают детей.","en":"Eternity is named the beloved from whom children are desired."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2178022befdc02bfa6f0e191d4eda013","tos.text-unit.sid-2178022befdc02bfa6f0e191d4eda013"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"eternity","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"eternity-children","neighbours":["eternity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Вечность названа любимой, от которой желают детей.","en":"Eternity is named the beloved from whom children are desired."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-43d628f1b2dac51aa46aad4912d1cafa","tos.text-unit.sid-43d628f1b2dac51aa46aad4912d1cafa"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"eternity","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"eternity-children","neighbours":["eternity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Вечность названа любимой, от которой желают детей.","en":"Eternity is named the beloved from whom children are desired."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.09","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-04f71dbccaf9ced0f7ee1f40b933de87","tos.text-unit.sid-04f71dbccaf9ced0f7ee1f40b933de87"]},"form":"Unschuld","speaker":"shadow","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"innocence","neighbours":["innocence-play","shadow"],"line":{"ru":"Тень оплакивает утраченную лживую невинность веры в добрых.","en":"The shadow laments the lost false innocence of faith in the good."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-faa230c570a677c48d9abfec0ac4b7bf","tos.text-unit.sid-faa230c570a677c48d9abfec0ac4b7bf"]},"form":"Kindern","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"children-work","neighbours":["attention","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель спрашивает гостей о приближающихся детях.","en":"The teacher asks his guests about the approaching children."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-09dbfa04d6f16c6b8baeec9d7cbae247","tos.text-unit.sid-09dbfa04d6f16c6b8baeec9d7cbae247"]},"form":"Kindern","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"children-work","neighbours":["bestowing-virtue","becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Заратустра просит гостей рассказать ему о его детях.","en":"Speaking of the children becomes the desired guest-gift."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-aa2f666c829b356bc5f81ec0cacad4df","tos.text-unit.sid-aa2f666c829b356bc5f81ec0cacad4df"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"children-work","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Дети изображены живыми деревьями собственной воли.","en":"The children are pictured as living trees of one’s will."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-61689620ad4d08df61f10c99303c8a41","tos.text-unit.sid-61689620ad4d08df61f10c99303c8a41"]},"form":"unschuldig","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"innocence","neighbours":["circle","innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Толпа не знает, что велико, мало, прямо и правдиво, и лжёт по невинности.","en":"The present rabble is attributed an unthinking distortion of truth."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-87a68516c8f8357eb8c60d20cdae9cf3","tos.text-unit.sid-87a68516c8f8357eb8c60d20cdae9cf3"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["creation","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-701d88382b6f19f40c59de218730608f","tos.text-unit.sid-701d88382b6f19f40c59de218730608f"]},"form":"Kinde","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["will","tablets-values","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Своё дело и свою волю Заратустра называет ближним.","en":"Zarathustra calls your own work and will your neighbor."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-521aed302d2b9071ea3732ed1d0f491a","tos.text-unit.sid-521aed302d2b9071ea3732ed1d0f491a"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-73f97a59c825f537f224423d55eefe05","tos.text-unit.sid-73f97a59c825f537f224423d55eefe05"]},"form":"Kind","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["identity","laughter","earth","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Ребёнок находит земные поводы смеяться.","en":"The child finds earthly reasons to laugh."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.17","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-eb6acb0ffabca8b7302368448982dd54","tos.text-unit.sid-eb6acb0ffabca8b7302368448982dd54"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["difference","zarathustra"]},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.17","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5d6868fcb19694beca5f5ea5bb95a193","tos.text-unit.sid-5d6868fcb19694beca5f5ea5bb95a193"]},"form":"Kindern","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"child-context","neighbours":["will","becoming","identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Безобразный человек начинает ослиную литанию среди коленопреклонённых гостей.","en":"The ugly one begins the ass litany among the kneeling guests."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.17","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-beec14eb0363fdcfa29bcb5a2abf9fa2","tos.text-unit.sid-beec14eb0363fdcfa29bcb5a2abf9fa2"]},"form":"Unschuld","speaker":"ugliest-man","addressee":"ass","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"innocence","neighbours":["circle","innocence-play","ugliest-man"],"line":{"ru":"Литания восхваляет ослиную невинность за пределами человеческих оценок.","en":"The litany praises asinine innocence beyond human valuations."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.17","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5018bd6bccb52ecae0eff107d0e27403","tos.text-unit.sid-5018bd6bccb52ecae0eff107d0e27403"]},"form":"Kindlein","speaker":"ugliest-man","addressee":"ass","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"child-context","neighbours":["ugliest-man"],"line":{"ru":"Литания хвалит осла за то, что он принимает нищих, королей и детей и отвечает плутам «иа».","en":"The litany praises the ass for accepting beggars, kings and children and answering knaves with “Yea.”"}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.18","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-bea5e82850b7c1a145a498a358bf6f73","tos.text-unit.sid-bea5e82850b7c1a145a498a358bf6f73"]},"form":"Menschenkinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"child-context","neighbours":["identity","difference","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель прерывает поклонение ослу собственным криком.","en":"The teacher interrupts worship of the ass with his own cry."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.18","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-1818ab4763aab4f58b0b4496b25ce618","tos.text-unit.sid-1818ab4763aab4f58b0b4496b25ce618"]},"form":"Kindlein","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["becoming","joy-lust","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Гости радуются возвращению к благочестивому детству.","en":"The guests rejoice at returning to pious childhood."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.18","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-d7adfe1b113501cc818295b3cf28532f","tos.text-unit.sid-d7adfe1b113501cc818295b3cf28532f"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["agency","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Возвращённая детскость гостей выражается молитвой.","en":"The guests’ recovered childishness is expressed through prayer."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.18","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b7ba576aa90365f535f7d718560a40bf","tos.text-unit.sid-b7ba576aa90365f535f7d718560a40bf"]},"form":"Kinderstube","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["courage","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель выводит детское озорство из пещеры на воздух.","en":"The teacher leads childish exuberance from the cave into open air."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.18","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-0975567941a42219c551c6b16cdd046d","tos.text-unit.sid-0975567941a42219c551c6b16cdd046d"]},"form":"Kindlein","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"child-context","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель разыгрывает образ детей и небесного царства.","en":"The teacher plays with the image of children and the heavenly kingdom."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9d84be22064d4987f590be19fc67ce57","tos.text-unit.sid-9d84be22064d4987f590be19fc67ce57"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"child-context","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Страдание желает наследников и будущих детей.","en":"Suffering desires heirs and future children."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2a8aada5d848098eed8b2b160fafa871","tos.text-unit.sid-2a8aada5d848098eed8b2b160fafa871"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"child-context","neighbours":["recurrence","will","identity","eternity","joy-lust","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Радость хочет себя, вечности и возвращения того же.","en":"Joy wants itself, eternity and the same returning."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ee51842cbbb5c70b08a152c5f7dfc3a5","tos.text-unit.sid-ee51842cbbb5c70b08a152c5f7dfc3a5"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"children-work","neighbours":["lion","becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Слёзы учителя сопровождают узнавание близости детей.","en":"The teacher’s tears accompany recognizing the children’s nearness."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3aed787db3bc681b14b7a606fac6fe70","tos.text-unit.sid-3aed787db3bc681b14b7a606fac6fe70"]},"form":"Kinder","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"children-work","neighbours":["lion","becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Приход льва открывает зрелость учителя и близость детей.","en":"The lion’s coming reveals the teacher’s ripeness and the children’s nearness."}}]}
